  "releaseNotes": "v.6.2.0\n- Improve: Added support for controlling the \"PreventDefault\" option for each hotkey entry.\n- Improve: Added the GetHotKey() method to retrieve a hotkey entry by its key combination.\n- Improve: Deprecated the \"State\" property of HotKeyOptions to simplify the syntax. Use the new \"Disabled\" property of the options and each HotKeyEntry instead.\n\nTo see all the change logs, please visit the following URL.\n- https://github.com/jsakamoto/Toolbelt.Blazor.HotKeys2/blob/master/RELEASE-NOTES.txt",
